==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Jar Base (Enemy Base)|Jar Base]].
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 10~26.67 seconds<sup>300f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Doge]] spawns.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 10~26.67 seconds<sup>300f~800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 140 seconds<sup>4,200f</sup>, delay 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Those Guys]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 0.67~1.33 seconds<sup>20f~40f</sup>.
**5 [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 2~3.33 seconds<sup>60f~100f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

